WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/notifications/pages/AuditLogPage.tsx — the default-exported page at route
  /notifications/audit. Reads `useAuditLogs()` (GET /api/v1/system/audit -> AuditLogEntry[]:
  {id, action, resource, details, createdAt}) and renders, inside a `PageContainer` (title
  "Audit Log", subtitle "Recent system-level changes recorded by the audit subsystem",
  max-w-5xl mx-auto) wrapping ONE `GlassPanel` ("Recent Activity", Clock icon), the exact ladder:
    isLoading            -> five `Skeleton` h-8 rows
    error                -> AlertTriangle + "Failed to load audit logs": <error.message>
    rows?.length         -> `FilterBar`>`SearchInput`(audit.searchPlaceholder) + `ActiveFilterChips`
                            (audit.filterLabel.search) + ( filtered.length
                              ? `DataTable`[Time, Action, Resource, Details]
                              : "audit.noMatches" )
    else                 -> "No audit entries found"
  Search is `useFilteredList(rows, q, ['action','resource','details'])` (case-insensitive substring).
  Reproduced 1:1 (covenant pt 2) — every panel, state, column, and string ported.

